#24800
UW section for the flag game arena~
This section is an add-on for the flag game arena.
It consists of 2 sections which are randomised mazes.
The mazes will change every zreset.. 5ticks or so.
Also i have 2 types of super aggro scripted sentinel mobs to slow down those triggered walking people.

I'll basically connect them to the river crossing on each side of the parapet.
Creating a new exciting way to go about in a flag game.

Anubis.
~
248 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#24801
An Underwater Abyss~
   The water ripples, swirls and surges dragging everything along with its
powerful current.  The water itself is very dark and murky, making it very hard
to see clearly.  Outlines of various forms can be vaguely seen moving around,
some quite bigger then the rest.  As the movement of the current shifts and
differentiates multiple exit chutes arise.  Swimming against this current is
futile, although pushing through the chute is a far wiser decision.    
~
