#24809
An Underwater Abyss~
   As the currents movements and constant dragging disorientates you in the
murky water a quick or what appears to be a clean opening can be seen.  
Without thinking twice you take the exit.  Suddenly a jagged reef appears in
front of you.  Instantaneously smashing your body parts into mulch.    

HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA - *COMFORT*
~
